            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Cafe_monolog_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Cafe... Maids... They seem related, but at the same time, they don't..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Cafe",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Cafe_Monolog_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Cafe_monolog_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "If I worked here, I'd have to clean all the floors here... Ugh."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Cafe",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Cafe_Monolog_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Cafe_monolog_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Cake... Tea... Looks delicious... Huh? Am I the one who should prepare that?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Cafe",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Cafe_Monolog_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Cafe_monolog_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I wanna sneak away and sleep somewhere..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Cafe",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Cafe_Monolog_5",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Cafe_monolog_5",
            "LocalizeEN": "How about a story about a maid's journey that starts at a cafe?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_LogIn_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_LogIn_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "You have come, my lord!\nWhat do you think, Sensei? A maid-like greeting, right?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_LogIn_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_LogIn_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hi-de-ho, Sensei! Maid Momoi has been a good girl while she was waiting!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_1_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_1_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "What should I do to escape from my maid job...?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_1_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_1_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Eek! Sensei!? When did you get here!?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_2_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_2_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "If everyone did their own housework all the time, we'd have less work to do!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_2_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_2_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Eh? That's true, but does it apply to me too? No way..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_3_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_3_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Sensei, I'm bored. Let's play a game together!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_3_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_3_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hmm? Aren't I a maid now?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_3_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_3_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Well then, let's play a game that features maids!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_4_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_4_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Writing a game scenario isn't easy... To be specific...!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_4_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_4_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "...Anyway, it's pretty difficult!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Lobby_5",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Lobby_5",
            "LocalizeEN": "If you're worried about what to do...\nThen why not leave it all to your trusty maid and take a rest!\nFor example, you could ask me!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Birthday_Player_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Birthday_Player_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Happy Birthday, my lord!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Birthday_Player_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Birthday_Player_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "What? You want some more maid-like phrases? I just said them."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Birthday_Player_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Birthday_Player_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "But yeah, true. Happy Birthday, Sensei!\nYour present is... the right to play games all night with me!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Birthday_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Birthday_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't really get it, but apparently it's the master's job to keep track of the maids' movements...\nSo, Sensei...? Is there anything you'd like to give me?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Birthday_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Birthday_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Wow! Thank you, Sensei!\nWhat? Really? You prepared one for Midori too?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_NewYear",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_NewYear",
            "LocalizeEN": "It's the new year... how time flies... Happy New Year, Sensei.\nI wonder what games will be released this year? I'm looking forward to it!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Xmas",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Xmas",
            "LocalizeEN": "There are lots of games on special sale for Christmas...\nThis is our chance to do some shopping, Sensei!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Halloween_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Halloween_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Halloween... Another season closely related to the Game Development Club...\nHere you go! Maid Momoi has prepared some candy for you!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Season_Halloween_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_Season_Halloween_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Huh? It's the opposite? Is that right...?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "WeaponGet",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExWeapon_Get",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_ExWeapon_Get",
            "LocalizeEN": "Listen up, Sensei! For a maid, equipment is more important than anything else! Infiltration, explosions, securing secrets. And world peace... To do that kind of work, you need good equipment!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_MemorialLobby_1_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_MemorialLobby_1_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hehehe... The sweets are delicious... \nThe sunshine is warm... and the sofa is soft and fluffy..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_MemorialLobby_2_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_MemorialLobby_2_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hmmm... cleaning...?\nI'll do it... after I just eat... and rest for a bit..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_MemorialLobby_3_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_MemorialLobby_3_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Huh? Sensei?\nI see. This is still a dream."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_MemorialLobby_4_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_MemorialLobby_4_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "To meet Sensei even in a dream... That seems nice...\nMaybe something fun will happen today... hehe..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_MemorialLobby_5",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_MemorialLobby_5",
            "LocalizeEN": "Zzz... Ah, bonus lives..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I came, I saw, and I won! ...Right?\nAnyway, Saiba Momoi the maid is here to battle!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ah, Sensei! I've been ready for that a long time...!\nHuh...? W-Wait a moment, Sensei!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_Season_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_Season_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ugh, there's too much work!\nI didn't know it would end up like this..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_Season_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_Season_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't understand, I don't understand...\nA phantom thief? An auction? A work of art? What is that! Is this some kind of game setting?!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_Season_End_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_Season_End_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Although many things happened, the heroes defeated the evil and returned home in high spirits...!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLogin_Season_End_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLogin_Season_End_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Well, that was the ending. Hmm? Sensei? Great work today!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLobby_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLobby_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "ん？メイドらしい\n働きぶりを見たい……？\n\nまあ一応、メイド服に\nなっているからね！\nうん！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hmm? Do you want to see a maid at work...?\nWell, I am wearing a maid outfit after all! Yup!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLobby_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLobby_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Why are there no maid classes where students can skip and take a nap? Don't you think that's a problem?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLobby_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLobby_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Oh, that's right! Hey, Sensei. Did you know? This mansion... \nis hiding a huge secret! My intuition is telling me so!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "UIEventLobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_EventLobby_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/CH0201_EventLobby_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Haha! Th-That really tickles, Sensei! I'm not good at being ticklish, but it's not that I don't like it!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_GeasGet_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_geasget_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "パワーアーップ！クリアに向けて！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Power up! Towards clearing!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Select_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_select_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "おお。そなたもゲームをプレイしに来たのか。新しいゲーマーは常に歓迎しておる。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Oh, you came to play games too. New gamers are always welcome."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Select_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_select_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "来たか、我が主よ。メイドのゲームとはなんなのか、楽しみだろう？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Come, my lord. I'm sure you're looking forward to what the maid's game is."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Select_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_select_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "いぇーい！頑張って作ったからね！今回は大丈夫なはず。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Well, I worked really hard on it! It should be fine this time."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Shout_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_shout_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "いくよ！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Let's go!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Shout_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_shout_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "くらえ！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Take this!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Shout_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_shout_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "発射！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Fire!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Start_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_start_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "さあ、お掃除を始めようか。全部綺麗に片づけてやるんだから。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Now, let's start cleaning. We're going to tidy everything up nicely."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Minigame",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ST0004_Minigame_Start_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_ST0004/st0004_minigame_start_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "目標は…、ハイスコア！…え？そんなシステムないって？",
            "LocalizeEN": "The goal is... a high score! ...What? There's no such system?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Formation",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Formation_In_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_formation_in_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドの気分になってみようかな～！",
            "LocalizeEN": "I wonder if I should try to feel like a maid!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Formation",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Formation_In_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_formation_in_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドみたいに、ぜーんぶ解決するよ！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Just like a maid, I'll solve all your problems!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Formation",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Formation_Select",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_formation_select",
            "LocalizeJP": "イエ～！見てる～先生？私が全部片づけてあげるね！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Yay! Are you watching, Sensei? I'll clean it all up for you!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Tactic_Defeat_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_tactic_defeat_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "逃げないで…、箒を持って…、って。箒は関係ないかあ。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Don't run away... Grab a broom... or, I guess the broom is irrelevant."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Tactic_Defeat_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_tactic_defeat_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドは…、こんな目に合わないはずなのに…。",
            "LocalizeEN": "A maid... shouldn't have to go through this..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Tactic_In_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_tactic_in_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "早く終わらせて、ゲームしに行こう？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Let's finish this quickly and go play games, okay?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Tactic_In_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_tactic_in_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "問題ないよ～！私がいるんだもん。",
            "LocalizeEN": "No problemo! I'm right here."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Tactic_Victory_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_tactic_victory_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "お掃除完了～！まっ、こんなもんだね。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Cleaning complete! Well, guess that's about it."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
