            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Defense_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_defense_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "You won't hit me!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_In_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_in_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "ゲームは実践のように！実践はゲームのように！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Games are like practice! Practice is like a game!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_In_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_in_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドの気分になるには、こういう仕事も必要だよね！",
            "LocalizeEN": "To feel like a maid, you need a job like this!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Move_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_move_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "とりあえず、お仕事終わり～。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Anyway, work is done."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Move_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_move_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "掃除完了～。疲れた～。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Cleaning complete! I'm tired..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Recovery_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_recovery_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "ありがとう。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Thank you!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Retire",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_retire",
            "LocalizeJP": "うげ。めまいが…。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ugh. I feel dizzy..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Shout_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_shout_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "いっくよー！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Here we go!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Shout_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_shout_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "これはどうだ！",
            "LocalizeEN": "How about this!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Shout_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_shout_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ya!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_TacticalAction_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_tacticalaction_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "次はどこー！？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Where to next!?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Victory_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_victory_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "ふっふふーん、見た先生？今日のメイドモモイ、最高だったでしょ？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hehehe, did you see that, Sensei? Maid Momoi today was the best, right?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Battle",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Battle_Victory_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_battle_victory_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "ふっふふーこれが、…ってうわあ！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hehehe! This is... Wah!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "CommonSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_CommonSkill",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_commonskill",
            "LocalizeJP": "掃除は嫌だ～。…うえ！？",
            "LocalizeEN": "I hate cleaning... Ehh!?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "う～また外れた～。…ってあれ？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ugh, I missed again... What the?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "私、もう怒ったんだから～！…え？ラッキー！",
            "LocalizeEN": "I'm already ticked off! ...Huh? Lucky!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "も～！当たれってばー！…って、なにこれ。",
            "LocalizeEN": "C'mon, hit something! ...What's this?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_Level_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_level_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "見つけた！レアアイテム！",
            "LocalizeEN": "I found it! The rare item!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_Level_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_level_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "おお、この力は一体…。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Oh, what kind of power is this...?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "ExSkill",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_ExSkill_Level_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_exskill_level_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "今の私は何も怖くない！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Now I'm not scared of anything!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_growup_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "レベルアップー！メイドレベルもアップー。え？メイドレベルはまだ…、だって？先生、それどういう意味？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Level up! Maid level also increased. Eh? My Maid level is not enough...? Sensei, what does that mean?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_growup_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "先生、へへ。私強くなったよ！え？じゃあ一緒に掃除しようって？それは…、ちょっと…。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hehe, Sensei! I've gotten stronger! Eh? You want us to clean up together? That's... a bit..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_growup_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドモモイの成長、とくとご覧あれ。どう？先生！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Take a look at how Maid Momoi has grown. What do you think, Sensei?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_growup_4",
            "LocalizeJP": "あーあ、仕方ないね、この最強メイドモモイ様が何でも解決してあげる！",
            "LocalizeEN": "Oh well, there's no other way, this strongest Maid Momoi-sama will solve anything!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "せ、先生といるとやっぱり楽しいかも。これは本心だからね。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I-I guess it's fun being with you after all, Sensei. I mean it honestly."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "聞いて、先生！メイドには報酬が大事なんだって！だからご褒美として…、私と遊ぼ？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Listen, Sensei! Rewards are important to a maid! So as a reward... Shall we play together?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "メイドも人間だよ！休まないと壊れちゃう…。だから、今から先生は私と一緒に、休憩するの！えへへ。",
            "LocalizeEN": "Maids are human too! If they don't rest, they'll break down... So, from now on, you're going to take a break with me! Ehehe."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10094,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Momoi_(Maid)_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0201/ch0201_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeJP": "ゲームでメイドが出てくると、高確率で攻略対象になるじゃん？だから先生。私のことも…、攻略してみない？",
            "LocalizeEN": "When maids appear in video games, there's a high chance they'll become a character whose affection can be won<ref group=\"note\">In visual novels, {{lj|攻略}} usually involves making the right choices when interacting with a character to raise his/her affection until the route for a romantic relationship is unlocked. Momoi is suggesting here that maids have a high chance of being such a character, in contrast to NPCs who do not have a romantic route.</ref>, right? So, Sensei, why don't you try... and win my affection too?"
        }
    ]
}
